SUMMARY:Deadline: Jumping Frames 2027: Hong Kong International Movement-Ima
 ge Festival\, Open Call (Copy Right Copy Left)
DESCRIPTION:Open call for dance and movement-image films up to 20 minutes f
 or the 2027 Jumping Frames festival. The 2027 theme\, Copy Right Copy Left
 \, explicitly invites AI and digital tools and asks about authorship in th
 e AI era. Entries via FilmFreeway (https://filmfreeway.com/CCDC_JumpingFra
 mes2027)\; earlier tiers closed 6 and 26 November\, final deadline 16 Dece
 mber 2026. Entry fees apply on most tiers.\n\nOrganisation: City Contempor
 ary Dance Company (CCDC)\nLocation: Hong Kong (festival August 2027). Open
  to filmmakers internationally.\nAward: Jumping Frames International Award
  HKD 15\,000 (figure from secondary listings of the 2027 call\; confirm on
  the official site). Entry fees vary by deadline tier.\nDuration: Festival
  in August 2027.\n\nMore: https://jumpingframes.com/en/?utm_source=artific
 ialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://jumpingframes.com/en/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm
 _medium=referral
LOCATION:Hong Kong (festival August 2027). Open to filmmakers international
 ly.
